<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Heftel started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Heftel started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it started coverage of Heftel Broadcasting Corp with a buy rating.</p>
